+### [2026-10-25] Standalone scripts are loaded without sys.modules registration
+
+**Context**: Extending `scripts/update_changelog.py` with a dataclass broke the
+existing script tests during collection.
+**Learning**: `tests/test_update_changelog.py` loads the script with
+`spec_from_file_location` and `exec_module` but does not insert the module into
+`sys.modules`. The `dataclasses` decorator then cannot find the class module.
+**Recommendation**: Avoid dataclasses in standalone scripts covered by this
+loader, or register the module in `sys.modules` before executing it.
+
